    {
      "text": "Stacked horizontal bar chart summarizing risk of bias and applicability concerns for 36 Xpert Ultra studies (high red, unclear yellow, low green). Risk of bias: patient selection 1 high, 5 unclear, 30 low; index test 36 low; reference standard 9 unclear, 27 low; flow and timing 36 low. Applicability: patient selection 4 high, 21 unclear, 11 low; index test 3 high, 1 unclear, 32 low; reference standard 5 unclear, 31 low.",
